IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TABLE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 TABLE-AREA.
 05 ROW OCCURS 3 TIMES.
  10 CELL PIC 9(2) OCCURS 2 TIMES VALUE 0.
01 I PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 J PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 TOTAL PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 3
 PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > 2
  COMPUTE CELL(I, J) = I * 10 + J
  ADD CELL(I, J) TO TOTAL
 END-PERFORM
END-PERFORM
DISPLAY TOTAL
GOBACK.
